-- en: "Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."
L["Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."] = "Ogni callback conserva il proprio testo in sospeso quando cambi scheda. Annulla e Ripeti modificano il buffer di quella callback. Reimposta ripristina l'ultimo codice salvato, o il modello per una nuova condizione, e può essere annullato. Applica principale salva e registra tutti i buffer delle callback e i metadati; Scarta elimina l'intera bozza. Se esci con modifiche, ti vengono proposti Applica, Scarta o Annulla. Verifica sintassi non esegue nessuna callback."
