-- en: "Fresh readable record with active, then name or nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible and spellID. Remaining time and duration are in seconds; remaining time is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate an active record."
L["Fresh readable record with active, then name or nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible and spellID. Remaining time and duration are in seconds; remaining time is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate an active record."] = "Record aggiornato e leggibile con active, poi name o nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible e spellID. Il tempo rimanente e la durata sono in secondi; il tempo rimanente viene limitato a zero. Un campo facoltativo non disponibile ha il proprio motivo; non invalida un record attivo."
-- en: "Fresh readable record with exists and, when present, a positive integer level."
